o characters to switch between. Ben is a devoted fan of old LucasArts adventures who collects odd items and combines them to solve puzzles, while Dan is an aspiring indie platform star who runs and jumps. Their different abilities work together as they try to stop several apocalypses that are all happening at once.\n\nThis one has a jokey, self-aware tone that pokes fun at both adventure and indie platformer conventions, and the pace is brisk. It is a single-player game, well suited to players who like clever item puzzles but also enjoy some platforming action."}}